# Personal / private working context
PersonalContext.md
RecentContext.md
plan.md
todo.md
READFIRST.md
handoff.md

# macOS junk
.DS_Store

# Python / uv
.venv/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
*.egg-info/

# The reviewer's merged baseline, by name wherever a copy lands: 1.3 GB, over GitHub's 100 MB limit.
merged*/
**/merged*/

# Big data never reaches git; output/ ships in the delivery archive, regenerable by `ark export`.
/ding
legacy-data/
# `/data/*`, not `/data/`: git never descends into an excluded directory to re-include a file.
/data/*
!/data/baseline.json
output/
*.duckdb
*.duckdb.wal
*.parquet
*.warc
*.warc.gz

# A round's tarball stays out; its small records stay in, regenerable from MANIFEST.txt's commit.
submissions/**/*.tar.gz
# Manifests `just verify raw` writes at the root.
submissions/SHA256SUMS
submissions/SHA256SUMS.stat
submissions/SHA1SUMS

# Email drafts and personal correspondence: `git archive HEAD` ships every tracked file.
private/

# Working notes and agent prompts, never deliverables.
legacy/notes/
handoff-research.md
handback-research.md
prompt-research-agent.md
handback-sources-A.md
handback-sources-B.md

# Written by `just state`; it embeds the VPS address and the open-decision list.
docs/ROUND.md

# Written by `build_report_docx.py --keep-markdown`; regenerable and addressed to the reviewer.
docs/report-sendable.md

# Word lock files, left behind when the .docx is open while it is rebuilt.
~$*

# Machine-local settings: the VPS address and anything else that must not be public.
local.env

# The fleet reads the tracked `.claude/` from its clone; below is machine-local or runtime scratch.
# The negation undoes a blanket `.claude/` in a local exclude or excludesFile.
!.claude/
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/.cc-writes/
.claude/*.lock
.claude/worktrees/
.claude/scheduled_tasks.json
.claude/checkpoints/
.claude/mailbox/

# The working goal prompt: dates, cadence and a private target.
goal.md
